{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <p><strong>3. V\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\/\u3067\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002<\/strong><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:36.03%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li><p>\u30d4\u30a2\u30ce\u3092\u3072\u304f<strong><u>\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/p><p>(T\u00f4i c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u01a1i piano.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u30d3\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u98f2\u3080<strong><u>\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/p><p>&nbsp;(T\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 u\u1ed1ng bia.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/u><\/p><p>Bi\u1ec3u th\u1ecb m\u1ed9t vi\u1ec7c g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m (ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m) b\u1edfi n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c m\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f3 ho\u1eb7c 1 h\u00e0nh vi n\u00e0o c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c (ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c) do ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh \u0111\u00f3 t\u1ea1o ra.&nbsp;<\/p><p><u>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac:<\/u><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:52.3%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>&nbsp;N\/\u3058\u3057\u3087\u5f62\uff08V\u308b\uff09\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3000 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nb